Dear all, 

A new version of adegenet has been released on CRAN (1.3-5). This version includes internal changes to comply with new CRAN policies, and some new functionalities too:
- gengraph: the implementation of a graph-based clustering (extending e-burst type of approach to any kind of genetic data)
- fasta2DNAbin: a function designed to read massive DNA alignments using minimum RAM resources; so far tested on about a hundred genomes with 4.5 million nucleotides).

Package is on CRAN now for every platform.

Best regards

Thibaut


